          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98280' id='3' type-v2='text' w='99064' x='468' y='860'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='18'>1. Which protein categories and stages (farm vs. retail) experienced the largest percentage and absolute price increases from 2022 to 2026?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='18'>2. How has the farm-to-retail price spread (Retail - Farm) and multiplier ratio (Retail/Farm) evolved, and does it point to retail margin expansion or compression?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='18'>3. Which stage (farm vs. retail) and category exhibits the highest month-over-month price volatility over the 4-year period?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='18'>4. Is farm-to-retail spread widening isolated to specific supply chains (e.g., Beef/Dairy), or is it happening uniformly across all five categories</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontsize='18'>5. When a farm-gate price shock occurs, how many months does it take to pass through to retail shelf prices across each protein category?</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
